# claude-md: each AGENTS.md has a CLAUDE.md beside it that only imports it, or links to it
spec: Finders
args: agent-files claude-md
-- AGENTS.md --
# Top
-- sub/AGENTS.md --
# Sub
-- sub/CLAUDE.md --
@AGENTS.md
Claude-only notes.
-- ok/AGENTS.md --
# Ok
-- ok/CLAUDE.md --
@AGENTS.md
-- linked/AGENTS.md --
# Linked
-- linked/CLAUDE.md -> AGENTS.md --
-- @stdout --
AGENTS.md: no CLAUDE.md beside it
sub/CLAUDE.md: holds more than @AGENTS.md
